{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SeekOut\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced, multiplayer hide-and-seek game where players are split into two teams: <strong>Runners</strong> try to hide, escape, and survive, while <strong>Catchers</strong> hunt them down. You can also join as a <strong>Spectator</strong> to watch and learn from your friends\u2019 strategies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong>Choose Your Role</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/96033a09b26c69b52fce5e1cea3817a3.poster.avif?t=1767529627\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/96033a09b26c69b52fce5e1cea3817a3.webm?t=1767529627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/96033a09b26c69b52fce5e1cea3817a3.mp4?t=1767529627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runner:</strong> Blend into the environment, build your escape, and survive the timer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catcher:</strong> Hunt down all Runners before time\u2019s up. Watch as structures decay and the map reveals their secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Transform into Props</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/da24971bf7203ecc256c6f461012fe02.poster.avif?t=1767529627\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/da24971bf7203ecc256c6f461012fe02.webm?t=1767529627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/da24971bf7203ecc256c6f461012fe02.mp4?t=1767529627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend into your surroundings by transforming into almost any object. Outwit your enemies with perfect disguises and unexpected movements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Power Orbs \u2013 Turn the Tide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/ac7a7170ef5a2fac432fba0ec03c8a75.poster.avif?t=1767529627\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/ac7a7170ef5a2fac432fba0ec03c8a75.webm?t=1767529627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/ac7a7170ef5a2fac432fba0ec03c8a75.mp4?t=1767529627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect special orbs across the map to gain temporary abilities. Stun enemies, teleport, reveal hidden players, or sabotage builds \u2014 the chaos is yours to control!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Core Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide &amp; Seek Reimagined</strong> \u2013 Multiplayer chaos where players become props or hunters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Building</strong> \u2013 Use simple structures to change the flow of every round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Abilities</strong> \u2013 Power orbs keep matches unpredictable and wild.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong> \u2013 Style your character with unlockable outfits, effects, and emotes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Maps</strong> \u2013 Discover secrets and strategic hiding spots in handcrafted environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Fun</strong> \u2013 No match is ever the same, thanks to player creativity and dynamic tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supports 5\u201315 Players</strong> \u2013 Ideal for parties, streams, or competitive hide-and-seek lovers.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768140?t=1767529627","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768140?t=1767529627","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/182fd5c8fc3c8711c27bdc72944e1a98c8b38d0d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767529627","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/182fd5c8fc3c8711c27bdc72944e1a98c8b38d0d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767529627","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SeekOut\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced, multiplayer hide-and-seek game where players are split into two teams: <strong>Runners</strong> try to hide, escape, and survive, while <strong>Catchers</strong> hunt them down. You can also join a